.TH "ZOXIDE" "1" "2021-04-12" "" "zoxide"
.SH NAME
\fBzoxide-edit\fR - edit the database interactively
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zoxide edit
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sorts the database by score, saves it, and opens an interactive editing
session for its entries. Requires \fBfzf\fR(1) to be installed.
.sp
Inside the session, the following keys modify the entry under the cursor:
.TS
tab(|);
l l.
    \fBKey\fR|\fBAction\fR
    \fBctrl-r\fR|T{
Reload the list from the database
T}
    \fBctrl-d\fR|T{
Delete the entry
T}
    \fBctrl-w\fR|T{
Increment the entry's rank
T}
    \fBctrl-s\fR|T{
Decrement the entry's rank
T}
    \fBenter\fR|T{
Exit the session
T}
.TE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -h, --help
Print help information.
.SH REPORTING BUGS
For any issues, feature requests, or questions, please visit:
.sp
